> PVWA

- The main GUI console you'll be working on
- End users will use this interface to retrieve password or launch private session
- Auditors will use this to monitor privileged sessions
- The classic GUI is mostly used by vault admins ro manage policies and permissions and to configure the PVWA and the other components

