> PAM Web Services

- The PAM web services is a Restful API that enables users to create, list, modify and delete entities in PAM using scripts and programs
- The main purpose of the PAM web services is to automate tasks that are usually performed manually using the UI and to incorporate them into system- and account-provisioning scripts

